<file path="api/activity.md">
# Activity API

Existing verified Better Auth bearer session and current health_data_processing consent required for all routes. Summary endpoints and Today additionally require descriptive_summaries. Owner always derives from session; strict body schemas reject owner/source impersonation. Responses use existing private/no-store wrapper.

| Method / path | Contract |
|---|---|
| POST /api/me/activities | Stable UUID create, 201; identical retry returns existing; different payload 409 |
| GET /api/me/activities | date optional local ISO date, cursor optional owned UUID, limit 1–50/default20, archived true/false/defaultfalse |
| GET /api/me/activities/:id | Owned detail, local-time preference and original UTC timestamps |
| PATCH /api/me/activities/:id | expectedVersion+reason and at least one field; transactional revisions; archive/restore via archived boolean |
| GET /api/me/activities/:id/revisions | Prior snapshots/reasons, newest version first |
| GET /api/me/activities/summary | Optional date, otherwise today in saved timezone |
| GET /api/me/activities/weekly | Optional date inside selected week, otherwise user's current week |
| GET /api/me/timeline | domain now accepts activity in addition to all/meal/glucose |
| GET /api/me/summaries/daily | Existing Nutrition top-level contract plus glucose and activity members |
| GET /api/me/today | Activity AVAILABLE with current summary and source-linked preview |

Synthetic create:

```json
{
  "id": "<runtime UUID>",
  "activityType": "walking",
  "startedAt": "<ISO timestamp with offset>",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "distanceKm": null,
  "steps": null,
  "reportedIntensity": "unknown",
  "source": "manual",
  "qualityStatus": "user_reported",
  "notes": null
}
```

Required id/type/start/duration. Types walking/cycling/running/strength/other. Duration integer 1–1440; start is real,>=1900; derived end cannot exceed current server time plus 5-minute clock tolerance. Client endedAt is rejected rather than independently trusted. Optional km 0–1000/three decimals, steps integer 0–1000000; null/omitted is unknown. Intensity unknown/light/moderate/vigorous; manual source only; quality user_reported or needs_review; nullable notes max 2000. These bounds are technical guards, not exercise recommendations.

Detail includes id/type/startedAt/endedAt/durationMinutes, nullable distanceKm/steps, intensity/source/quality/note, version/archive, recordedAt/receivedAt/createdAt/updatedAt, localDate/localTime/endLocalDate/endLocalTime/timezone. Start+30minutes returns end exactly 1800000ms later. Input timezone offsets are preserved semantically as instants, not a separate display-zone field.

PATCH example: `{"expectedVersion":1,"reason":"Correct duration","durationMinutes":45}`. Recalculates end, preserves omitted metrics/source/notes, stores prior state. Archive/restore uses version/reason plus archived true/false; no hard DELETE route. List returns items/details, nextCursorUUID|null and timezone.

Summary returns date/startDate/endDate(exclusive)/timezone/locale/firstDay, count/eligibleCount/reviewCount, durationMinutes|null, distanceKm and steps as `{value,knownSessions,totalSessions,coverage}`, days, activeDays, latest|null, analyticsState, computedAt, freshness CURRENT, coverageStatus RECORDED_ONLY, source manual, attribution START_LOCAL_DATE, durationMethod SUM_REPORTED_SESSIONS and computationVersion activity-reported-v1. Daily firstDay null/days length 1; weekly firstDay 7 for id-ID/days length 7.

Eligible means active user_reported session. No eligible records→durationnull/INSUFFICIENT_DATA, not an assertion of inactivity. One or more→READY. Unknown optional totals staynull; partial totals retain coverage. Start-local-date attribution includes cross-midnight sessions wholly; overlapping sessions are summed independently. Weekly calendar dates use saved locale/timezone, not fixed168-hour windows. Corrections/archive/restore recompute on next read. No calories, inferred goals or medical conclusions.

Errors: 400 invalid strict schema/date/source/numeric/body or invalid opaque timeline cursor; 401 absent/inactive/unverified session; 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED; 404 owned record/cursor missing, including cross-user IDs; 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT/VERSION_CONFLICT; 422 ACTIVITY_NOT_COMPLETED when merged correction would end in future; safe 500 via existing wrapper. Sensitive payloads are not added to logs.

Bruno folder 11 Activity extends the same collection/environment with 20 ordered executable cases. Runtime sessionToken,otherSessionToken,restrictedSessionToken,newActivityId,eventTime; other owner has full consent, restricted health only. Full collection additionally needs newMealId/newGlucoseId. Run `bru run --env test` from collection root in Docker network beokay-test_default with runtime --env-var injection. Use fresh UUIDs/accounts for ordered version 1→4 cases, and eventTime at least 60 minutes before execution. No tracked credentials. Actual results are recorded in [testing](../testing/activity.md).
</file>

<file path="api/glucose.md">
# Glucose API — Slice 3

All private routes use existing verified Better Auth bearer sessions. User identity comes from the session, never a body/query owner. Every route needs current `health_data_processing`; summaries/Today also need `descriptive_summaries`. Responses are private/no-store using existing HTTP wrappers. Only manual capillary-blood glucometer entry is supported.

| Method / path | Request / behavior |
|---|---|
| POST /api/me/glucose | Create, 201; same UUID/input retry returns existing record; changed input/UUID reuse → 409 |
| GET /api/me/glucose | `date?` ISO local date, `cursor?` owned UUID, `limit` 1–50 default20, `archived` true/false defaultfalse |
| GET /api/me/glucose/:id | Owned detail, current display preference |
| PATCH /api/me/glucose/:id | expectedVersion, reason, at least one changed field; 200 or 409 version conflict |
| GET /api/me/glucose/:id/revisions | Previous version snapshots and reasons, newest first |
| GET /api/me/glucose/summary | Optional ISO local `date`, otherwise today in saved timezone |
| GET /api/me/timeline | Meal+glucose source read model: `domain=all|meal|glucose`, `date?`, opaque `cursor?`, limit1–30 default20, archived true/false |
| GET /api/me/summaries/daily | Existing top-level Nutrition daily contract plus `glucose` summary, same optional date |
| GET /api/me/today | Nutrition and Glucose AVAILABLE; Activity/Medication unavailable; first five source-linked same-day timeline events |

## Input and examples

Synthetic create input (UUID/time must be generated at runtime):

```json
{
  "id": "<runtime UUID>",
  "originalValue": 5.5,
  "originalUnit": "mmol/L",
  "measuredAt": "<ISO timestamp with offset>",
  "mealContext": "after_meal",
  "source": "manual_glucometer",
  "measurementType": "capillary_blood",
  "qualityStatus": "user_reported",
  "notes": null
}
```

Required: id, positive finite originalValue (up to four decimals), originalUnit and measuredAt. Canonical value must be 1–2000 mg/dL; this is a technical input guard, not a health target. Measurement timestamp must be real, >=1900 and no more than five minutes ahead of current server time. Notes nullable/max2000. Strict schemas reject unknown fields such as userId or sourceRecordId. CGM/external types are rejected.

Contexts: fasting, before_meal, after_meal, bedtime, other, unknown (default). Source/type defaults are manual_glucometer/capillary_blood. Quality defaults user_reported; needs_review adds server-controlled user_flagged and excludes the reading from averages. No context is inferred from meals.

With a mg/dL display preference, the synthetic input above returns these representative fields:

```json
{
  "originalValue": 5.5,
  "originalUnit": "mmol/L",
  "valueMgDl": 99.088,
  "displayValue": 99,
  "displayUnit": "mg/dL",
  "converted": true,
  "source": "manual_glucometer",
  "measurementType": "capillary_blood",
  "qualityStatus": "user_reported",
  "qualityFlags": [],
  "version": 1,
  "archivedAt": null
}
```

Full detail also has id, measuredAt, localDate/localTime/timezone, context/notes, recordedAt/receivedAt/createdAt/updatedAt. The entered unit/value are preserved. Canonical multiplication uses Decimal ×18.016; converted display mg/dL rounds to integer, mmol/L to one decimal. Display in the original unit retains original precision. A preference change does not increment observation version.

Correction example: `{"expectedVersion":1,"reason":"Correct entry","originalValue":6.1}`. Omitted fields remain unchanged. Archive/restore: same version/reason fields plus `archived:true|false`. Every successful PATCH records previous state transactionally, increments version, and affects the next summary/timeline read. No DELETE route.

List response: `{items:[detail...], nextCursor:UUID|null, timezone, displayUnit}`. Date/archive filters compose. Timeline response has `{supportedDomains:["meal","glucose"],timezone,nextCursor,items}`; each event includes domain, recordId, occurredAt, local date/time and domain fields. Opaque cursors preserve descending event-time/domain/ID tie order; historical owner-scoped meal UUID cursors remain accepted. Cursor contents confer no authorization.

## Analytics contract

Summary returns date/timezone/displayUnit, count, eligibleCount, reviewCount, latest/detail|null, mean/minimum/maximum|null, analyticsState, computationVersion=`glucose-descriptive-v1`, computedAt, freshness=`CURRENT`, source and measurementType. Latest may be user-flagged and retains its label. Aggregates require at least two active, user_reported readings; otherwise null/INSUFFICIENT_DATA. Empty means count0/latestnull, not glucose0. Mean is arithmetic over canonical measured values; conversion is only for display. No unobserved values, targets, TIR or diagnosis.

These summaries are computed on read; source correction/archive/restore is reflected on the next read. No persistent daily/weekly projection, background computation, contextual inference or offline sync is implemented by these endpoints. Today's overall analyticsState remains NOT_AVAILABLE for the broader unfinished Insights feature; the Glucose summary has its own eligibility state.

## Errors and Bruno

400: malformed/strict schema, invalid numeric/unit/source/context/date, empty patch or invalid opaque cursor. 401: absent/inactive/unverified session per existing guard. 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED: missing/withdrawn current purpose. 404: owned record/cursor not found, including another user's ID. 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT or VERSION_CONFLICT: duplicate ID with different input or stale correction. 422 GLUCOSE_VALUE_OUT_OF_DOMAIN: merged correction outside canonical guard. Safe 500 uses existing error wrapper; no sensitive payload logging added.

Bruno folder `10 - Glucose` extends the existing collection/environment with 18 executable cases. Runtime variables: sessionToken, otherSessionToken (different owner), restrictedSessionToken (health consent only), newGlucoseId and eventTime. The full collection also needs newMealId. Never persist credentials in tracked environment files.

From collection root inside the isolated Docker network: `bru run --env test` with those runtime `--env-var` values. Run on fresh fixtures because correction/archive tests depend on versions1→4. Actual results and fixture setup are in [testing](../testing/glucose.md).
</file>

<file path="api/nutrition.md">
# Nutrition API — Slice 2

Semua rute di bawah memakai Better Auth verified bearer session dan purpose consent current `health_data_processing`. Summary dan Today juga memerlukan `descriptive_summaries`. Identitas selalu diturunkan dari sesi. Tidak ada body userId yang diterima. Error wrapper, no-store dan request ID mengikuti API existing.

| Method / path | Request | Respons / aturan |
|---|---|---|
| GET `/api/foods/search?q=...` | 2–80 karakter | Maksimal 20 referensi bersama dan makanan pribadi milik akun aktif; nama case-insensitive |
| POST `/api/me/foods` | FoodInput | 201, buat makanan pribadi; tidak bisa menerbitkan referensi global |
| PATCH `/api/me/foods/:id` | FoodInput penuh | 200, hanya pemilik; snapshot meal lama tidak berubah |
| GET `/api/me/meals` | `date?`, `cursor?`, `limit?` 1–30 default 20, `archived?` true/false | items, nextCursor, timezone; keyset consumedAt DESC/id DESC; tanggal dalam timezone preferensi |
| POST `/api/me/meals` | MealInput | 201; ID UUID stabil dari klien untuk retry. ID+payload sama mengembalikan catatan existing; payload berbeda pada ID sama → 409 |
| GET `/api/me/meals/:id` | UUID | Detail, item snapshot, total/coverage, versi, waktu kejadian dan pencatatan |
| PATCH `/api/me/meals/:id` | expectedVersion, reason, fields opsional | Optimistic correction; previous state disimpan transactionally; full replacement bila items diberikan |
| GET `/api/me/meals/:id/revisions` | UUID | Versi sebelumnya dan alasan; owner/consent tetap wajib |
| GET `/api/me/timeline` | Parameter pagination sama dengan meals | Derived meal events; `supportedDomains:["meal"]`; belum cross-domain timeline penuh |
| GET `/api/me/summaries/daily?date=...` | ISO date opsional, default hari pengguna | Nutrition-only mealCount/totals/coverage/recent/computedAt; current source read, bukan tabel summary persisten |
| GET `/api/me/today` | Existing | Tambahan `nutrition`; metric nutrition AVAILABLE, lainnya belum diimplementasikan; recent meal events |

## FoodInput

`name` 1–120, `source` 1–160, `sourceVersion` opsional/null 1–80, `status` user_reported/estimated. `per100g` memuat calories, carbohydrates, protein, fat, fiber; setiap nilai number ≥0 hingga 10000 dengan maksimal 4 desimal atau null. Satuan: energi kkal, lainnya gram. Endpoint tidak menandai masukan pengguna sebagai clinically verified. Catalog awal tidak di-seed dengan nilai nutrisi rekaan.

## MealInput

```json
{
  "id": "UUID-dibuat-saat-runtime",
  "category": "lunch",
  "consumedAt": "2026-11-08T05:00:00Z",
  "notes": null,
  "items": [
    { "name": "Nama makanan yang dicatat", "quantity": 1, "unit": "portion", "grams": null }
  ]
}
```

Contoh bersifat struktural; ganti ID dengan UUID valid dan timestamp dengan kejadian sebenarnya. category: breakfast/lunch/dinner/snack; consumedAt timestamp ISO dengan offset eksplisit, tahun ≥1900 dan tidak melebihi waktu server +5 menit. notes maksimal 2000; 1–30 items.

Item: name wajib, foodId UUID opsional/null, quantity >0 maksimal 10000 (4 desimal), unit g/portion/piece/ml. `g` menggunakan quantity sebagai gram; grams jika diberikan harus sama. Unit lain memerlukan total grams dan gramsBasis weighed/user_estimate untuk kalkulasi; keduanya nullable. Tidak ada konversi otomatis porsi/mL ke gram. Flutter memberi label perkiraan untuk gram unit non-g. Item tanpa referensi tidak mendapat nilai gizi rekaan.

Koreksi memerlukan `expectedVersion` dan reason 1–300. Patch dapat mengganti category, consumedAt, notes, items atau archived. Dalam items koreksi, `id` merujuk item versi existing; referensi/snapshot lama dipertahankan jika foodId sama atau tidak dikirim. `foodId:null` secara eksplisit melepas referensi. Item baru tanpa id mengambil snapshot katalog saat itu. Nama item bebas dapat dikoreksi; nama snapshot katalog tidak ditulis ulang dari klien. Item yang dihilangkan dari array tidak ada pada versi baru tetapi tetap ada dalam revision lama.

`archived:true` mengecualikan record dari daftar aktif, timeline dan summary. `archived:false` memulihkannya. Tidak ada hard-delete endpoint pada slice ini. Detail arsip tetap owner-scoped.

## Perhitungan dan error

Nutrient = nilai per 100 g × total gram /100 dengan Decimal dan pembulatan 4 desimal. Data hilang tetap null. Setiap total memiliki value, knownItems, totalItems, coverage UNKNOWN/PARTIAL/COMPLETE. Partial adalah jumlah item yang diketahui, bukan estimasi total penuh. Empty daily summary mempunyai mealCount 0 dan nilai nutrient null, analytics INSUFFICIENT_DATA. Daily rows dibaca dalam RepeatableRead; batas hari memakai PostgreSQL AT TIME ZONE, termasuk hari DST 23/25 jam.

401 sesi tidak valid; 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED; 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (termasuk ID/date/portion invalid); 404 MEAL_NOT_FOUND/FOOD_NOT_FOUND/CURSOR_NOT_FOUND tanpa bocor pemilik; 409 VERSION_CONFLICT/IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT/INVALID_ITEM_REFERENCE; 413/415 mengikuti wrapper; 500 generik tanpa payload sensitif.

Bruno folder `09 - Nutrition` berisi 16 request (create/search/read/retry/correct/revisions/timeline/summary/negative/archive/restore). Environment bersama `test` hanya berisi baseUrl. Inject sessionToken, restrictedSessionToken (health consent aktif tetapi summary consent tidak), newMealId UUID dan eventTime ISO valid saat runtime. Jangan menyimpan token/password dalam koleksi. CLI dijalankan pada Docker network `beokay-test_default`.
</file>

