# API — beOkay

Pembaruan Slice 4: [Activity API](activity.md) menambah pencatatan sesi, revisions/archive dan summary harian/mingguan. Today dan timeline sekarang mendukung makanan/glukosa/aktivitas. Bruno folder11 Activity menambah20 executable cases; environment tetap satu.

Pembaruan Slice 3: [Glucose API](glucose.md) aktif dengan source/original units, koreksi/revisions/archive dan summary. Today memuat Nutrition/Glucose AVAILABLE; timeline kini meal+glucose; daily summary mempertahankan kontrak Nutrition dengan anggota glucose. Folder Bruno `10 - Glucose` menambahkan 18 kasus. Contoh foundation di bawah bersifat historis.

Pembaruan Slice 2: [Nutrition API](nutrition.md) menambahkan personal food catalog, meal create/read/correct/archive/restore, revisions, meal-only timeline dan daily Nutrition summary. Today sekarang memuat `nutrition` nyata dan metric nutrition AVAILABLE. Contoh Today Foundation di bawah adalah kontrak tahap awal; domain selain Nutrition tetap belum tersedia.

## Today Foundation

`GET /api/me/today`: sesi Better Auth verified; consent current `health_data_processing` dan `descriptive_summaries` wajib. Identitas selalu dari sesi, tanpa body/parameter userId. Respons `no-store`, request ID dan error wrapper existing.

```json
{
  "displayName": "Nama pengguna",
  "timezone": "Asia/Jakarta",
  "glucoseUnit": "mg/dL",
  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "greeting": "Selamat pagi",
  "generatedAt": "2026-11-09T02:00:00.000Z",
  "computationVersion": "today-foundation-v1",
  "analyticsState": "NOT_AVAILABLE",
  "metrics": [
    { "domain": "glucose", "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "value": null },
    { "domain": "nutrition", "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "value": null },
    { "domain": "activity", "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "value": null },
    { "domain": "medication", "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "value": null }
  ],
  "goals": { "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "items": [] },
  "timeline": { "availability": "NOT_IMPLEMENTED", "items": [] }
}
```

Contoh bersifat sintetis. Nilai null berarti domain belum tersedia, bukan pengukuran nol. 401 untuk sesi hilang/kedaluwarsa, 403 `CONSENT_REQUIRED` untuk consent tidak aktif, 500 generik untuk kegagalan internal. Tidak ada endpoint tracking baru pada slice ini. Koleksi Bruno: [`bruno/`](bruno/); instruksi dan hasil: [pengujian core](../testing/core-health-experience.md).

## Authentication & Personalization

Basis URL dev: `http://localhost:3000`. Semua respons API membawa `X-Request-Id` dan `Cache-Control: no-store`.
Perilaku di bawah ini diverifikasi dengan menjalankan API di stack uji terisolasi (Docker). Koleksi Bruno menyusul di tahap berikutnya.

## Format error
```json
{ "error": { "code": "CONSENT_REQUIRED", "message": "…", "requestId": "…", "details": { } } }
```
`401 UNAUTHENTICATED` · `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`/`MALFORMED_JSON` · `403 CONSENT_REQUIRED` · `409 …` · `413`/`415` · `422 …` · `500 INTERNAL_ERROR` (tanpa detail internal). `VALIDATION_ERROR` hanya memuat `path` dan `code` isian, tidak pernah nilainya.
Respons error milik Better Auth (`/api/auth/*`) memakai format bawaannya: `{ "message", "code" }`.

## Autentikasi (Better Auth 1.7.18)
Better Auth adalah satu-satunya otoritas. Endpoint asli dipakai apa adanya:

| Aksi | Endpoint |
|---|---|
| Daftar | `POST /api/auth/sign-up/email` `{name, email, password}` |
| Masuk | `POST /api/auth/sign-in/email` `{email, password}` |
| Sesi | `GET /api/auth/get-session` |
| Keluar | `POST /api/auth/sign-out` |
| Kirim ulang verifikasi | `POST /api/auth/send-verification-email` `{email}` |
| Minta reset | `POST /api/auth/request-password-reset` `{email}` |
| Reset | `POST /api/auth/reset-password` `{newPassword, token}` |
| Ganti sandi | `POST /api/auth/change-password` |
| Daftar/cabut sesi | `GET /api/auth/list-sessions`, `POST /api/auth/revoke-session`, `/revoke-other-sessions`, `/revoke-sessions` |

Aturan yang berlaku (teramati):
- Kata sandi 10–128 karakter. Pendaftaran **tidak** membuat sesi; email verifikasi dikirim. Masuk sebelum verifikasi → `403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED` (`sendOnSignIn` diaktifkan untuk mengirim ulang tautan; pengiriman ulang itu belum diuji terpisah).
- Mendaftar dengan email yang sudah ada menghasilkan respons yang sama dengan email baru (`200`, tanpa token): tidak membocorkan keberadaan akun. `request-password-reset` juga seragam untuk email dikenal maupun tidak.
- Setelah reset kata sandi, semua sesi lama dicabut.
- **Sesi mobile**: plugin `bearer`. Respons `sign-in` memuat header `set-auth-token`; kirim `Authorization: Bearer <token>` pada permintaan berikutnya. Cookie `better-auth.session_token` (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax) tetap dikeluarkan untuk klien web.
- Pemeriksaan `Origin` hanya melindungi sesi berbasis cookie; klien native tanpa cookie dan tanpa header `Origin` tetap diterima.
- Rate limit (memori, per IP, jendela 60 dtk), dikonfigurasi: sign-in 5, sign-up 5, request-password-reset 3, reset-password 5, send-verification-email 3, change-password 5, lainnya 120. Melebihi → `429`. Teruji: sign-in (percobaan ke-6 dalam semenit → 429); batas lain baru dikonfigurasi, belum diuji satu per satu.
- IP klien: dari koneksi; dari `X-Forwarded-For` hanya bila `TRUST_PROXY=true`. Header internal `x-beokay-client-ip` dari klien selalu dibuang.
- Tautan di email mengarah ke halaman server: `/auth/verified` (hasil verifikasi) dan `/auth/reset-password?token=…` (formulir; token dibaca JS lalu dihapus dari URL; CSP ketat; `Referrer-Policy: no-referrer`).

## Rute aplikasi
Semua `/api/me/*` butuh sesi valid dengan email terverifikasi. `userId` selalu dari sesi.

### Persetujuan
| Metode & rute | Keterangan |
|---|---|
| `GET /api/consent-policies/current` | Publik. `{version, effectiveDate, summary, purposes[{purpose, required, title, description, dataCategories, withdrawalEffect}]}` |
| `GET /api/me/consents` | `{policyVersion, purposes[{purpose, required, status, policyVersion, grantedAt, withdrawnAt}], history[]}`. `status`: `granted`, `withdrawn`, `not_given`, `reconsent_required` |
| `POST /api/me/consents` | `{policyVersion, purposes[], source?}`. Versi tak sesuai → `422 POLICY_VERSION_MISMATCH`. Idempoten |
| `POST /api/me/consents/withdraw` | `{purposes[]}`. Idempoten; riwayat tidak dihapus |

Tujuan: `health_data_processing` (wajib), `descriptive_summaries` (wajib), `product_analytics` (opsional, tidak pernah pra-pilih). Teks kebijakan v1.0 adalah **draf** dan wajib ditinjau pihak berwenang.

### Onboarding
| Metode & rute | Keterangan |
|---|---|
| `GET /api/me/onboarding` | `{state, emailVerified, steps[{key, done}], introSeenAt, completedAt, version, requiresConsentReview}` |
| `PATCH /api/me/onboarding` | `{introSeen: true, expectedVersion?}`. Versi tak cocok → `409 VERSION_CONFLICT` |
| `POST /api/me/onboarding/complete` | Idempoten. Langkah kurang → `409 ONBOARDING_INCOMPLETE {missingSteps}` |

### Profil pribadi
`GET /api/me/profile` → `{exists, displayName, birthYear, completeness{complete, missing[]}, createdAt, updatedAt}`.
`PATCH /api/me/profile` `{displayName?, birthYear?|null}` (minimal satu). `displayName` 1–80 karakter tanpa karakter kontrol.

### Profil kesehatan (butuh persetujuan `health_data_processing`)
`GET`, `PUT` (ganti penuh), `PATCH` (parsial) pada `/api/me/health-profile`. Isian: `diagnosisStatus`, `diabetesType`, `diagnosedYear`, `treatmentContext[]`.
Respons memuat `provenance: {source: "user_reported", clinicallyVerified: false}` dan `eligibilityStatus`.
Kesalahan khas: `422 DETAILS_REQUIRE_DIAGNOSIS`, `422 DIAGNOSIS_BEFORE_BIRTH`, `409 HEALTH_PROFILE_NOT_CREATED` (PATCH sebelum PUT), `403 CONSENT_REQUIRED`.
`PATCH` yang mengubah status dari `diagnosed` ke lainnya mengosongkan `diabetesType` dan `diagnosedYear`.

### Preferensi
`GET /api/me/preferences` → `{locale, timezone, glucoseUnit, textSize, reduceMotion, isDefault, updatedAt}`.
`PATCH` `{locale?, timezone?, glucoseUnit?, textSize?, reduceMotion?}`. `timezone` harus IANA valid; `locale` saat ini hanya `id-ID`.

## Konfigurasi (env)
`BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` (≥ 32), `BETTER_AUTH_URL`, `TRUSTED_ORIGINS`, `TRUST_PROXY`, `EMAIL_FROM`, `SMTP_HOST/PORT/SECURE/USER/PASS`, `DATABASE_URL`. Aplikasi menolak start bila konfigurasi tidak valid.
</file>

<file path="architecture/activity.md">
# Activity — Slice 4 online

Activity owns its routes, Zod contracts, service, repository and model. It reuses verified Better Auth sessions, current-purpose consent and existing owner UUID. No new identity, password, theme, state-management or API architecture.

Sessions are completed, manually reported activities: walking, cycling, running, strength or other. The source start timestamp and integer duration determine end time on the server and in the form preview. Optional km/steps are nullable, including explicit zero only when supplied. Intensity is self-reported, not calculated. Needs-review records remain visible and are excluded from aggregate totals. No calories, GPS, heart-rate measurements, clinical advice or inferred goal completion.

Create uses stable client UUID plus hash of validated input; repeated identical and concurrent retries return the existing session. Different payload reuse conflicts. Corrections require expectedVersion/reason and atomically update owner-scoped source, store prior RecordRevision and metadata-only audit. Archive/restore are versioned changes. Prisma and database CHECKs enforce time/duration, source, state and numeric invariants.

History is owner-scoped start-time/ID keyset pagination with local-date/archive filters. Daily/weekly reads use current active source rows in RepeatableRead. Week boundaries use the user's locale via Intl.Locale.getWeekInfo and local dates in saved IANA timezone. Current supported locale id-ID starts Sunday; en-GB Monday is covered in domain tests. PostgreSQL converts calendar bounds to instants, including 23/25-hour days.

Every session is attributed wholly to its start-local date, including cross-midnight sessions. Reported durations are summed per eligible session; overlapping sessions are not deduplicated into unique active minutes. Count0 proves no matching records, not physical inactivity. No eligible duration returns null; optional totals expose knownSessions/totalSessions and UNKNOWN/PARTIAL/COMPLETE. Responses include source, method version, coverage, timestamp, analytics eligibility and freshness. Corrections affect the next read without stale persisted summaries.

Today and daily composite include Activity. Unified timeline UNION reads meal/glucose/activity source tables, with occurrence/domain/ID ordering, existing cursor compatibility and no duplicate writable event table. Flutter Today renders type/duration/source and navigates to the original session. Quick Record uses the existing launcher. No full Log/Insights tab or global weekly analytics is claimed here.

Flutter feature has data/application/presentation, shared account-captured writes, API/consent/preference dependencies, reusable cards/form controls and editorial layout. Forms guard unsaved changes and freeze uncertain payloads for retry; conflicts require reload. Successful writes invalidate detail, list, daily, weekly and Today. History/detail/weekly provide loading, empty, consent and retry states. Local input time is explicitly device timezone; output follows preferences. Weekly day selection links dated history.

Offline durable storage/sync, goals, medication and P1 remain later slices. Online API idempotency does not imply offline queue support. Composite Today is not a single cross-domain transaction. No production performance or complete accessibility certification is claimed.
</file>

<file path="architecture/auth-personalization.md">
# Arsitektur — Authentication & Personalization (backend)

Bagian Flutter ditambahkan saat tahap UI.

## Batas dan dependensi
```
server.ts
 ├─ features/auth          (Better Auth, guard sesi, halaman verifikasi/reset)
 ├─ features/consent       (registri kebijakan, riwayat persetujuan)
 ├─ features/profile       → health-profile (hanya eligibility), auth (updateUser)
 ├─ features/health-profile→ consent
 ├─ features/preferences
 └─ features/onboarding    → consent (+ membaca tabel profil/kesehatan/pengaturan)
shared/{errors,http,audit}   infrastructure/{database,email}   config/env.ts
```
Panah satu arah; tidak ada siklus. `features/*` tidak mengimpor satu sama lain kecuali yang tertera. Setiap fitur memiliki `routes` (HTTP), `service` (aturan bisnis, transaksi), `repository` (Prisma), `schema` (Zod).

## Keputusan
- **Better Auth satu-satunya otoritas** identitas, kata sandi, sesi, verifikasi, reset. Tidak ada tabel atau mekanisme kata sandi lain. Status verifikasi email tidak diduplikasi di tabel aplikasi.
- **Sesi mobile = plugin `bearer`.** Token dikembalikan di header `set-auth-token`; klien menyimpannya di penyimpanan aman.
- **Email via SMTP** (`nodemailer`): satu antarmuka `EmailSender`, penyedia apa pun yang mendukung SMTP. Dev/uji memakai Mailpit sehingga email tidak keluar. Pengiriman tidak ditunggu (anti timing). Log hanya memuat jenis email, bukan alamat atau tautan.
- **Status onboarding diturunkan**, bukan disimpan; penyelesaian memakai `SELECT … FOR UPDATE` dalam transaksi sehingga idempoten dan aman terhadap permintaan paralel; `version` untuk konkurensi optimistik.
- **Persetujuan ditegakkan di server** lewat `consentService.requireConsent`; versi kebijakan lama tidak dianggap sah (`reconsent_required`).
- **Validasi** di batas HTTP dengan Zod; badan permintaan dibatasi 64 KB dan harus `application/json`.
- **Kesalahan**: satu format; error tak terduga dicatat tanpa pesan atau data dan dijawab `500` generik.
- **Log** JSON per permintaan (`requestId`, metode, path tanpa query, status, durasi, `userId`); tanpa header, badan, token.
- **Nama tampilan** satu sumber (`users.name`).
- **Tanpa CORS**: klien adalah aplikasi native. Perlu dipertimbangkan ulang bila target web dipakai.

## Docker
Semua eksekusi di container (lihat `AGENTS.md`). Container dev dan uji berjalan sebagai UID host (`HOST_UID`/`HOST_GID`) sehingga tidak membuat berkas milik root pada bind mount. Stack uji (`compose.test.yaml`) memakai Postgres di tmpfs, Mailpit, dan tanpa port yang dipublikasikan.

## Batasan yang diketahui
- Rate limit disimpan di memori proses: berlaku untuk satu instance. Skala horizontal butuh penyimpanan bersama.
- Teks kebijakan persetujuan adalah draf, belum ditinjau hukum.
- Belum ada tes otomatis (tahap berikutnya); verifikasi di tahap ini berupa uji eksploratif terhadap API yang berjalan.
</file>

<file path="architecture/core-health-experience.md">
# Core Health Experience

Pembaruan Slice 4: [arsitektur Activity](activity.md) menambahkan sesi manual serta ringkasan harian/mingguan berdasarkan locale/timezone, dan timeline tiga domain. Bagian fondasi di bawah adalah histori tahap sebelumnya.

Pembaruan Slice 3: [arsitektur Glucose](glucose.md) memperluas tracking online, Today dan preview sumber, timeline read model meal+glucose serta daily composite. Quick Record food/glucose aktif. Fondasi auth/onboarding tetap dipakai. Bagian Slice 1–2 di bawah adalah histori, bukan status fitur terbaru.

Pembaruan Slice 2: [arsitektur Nutrition](nutrition.md) sudah diterapkan. Today mengonsumsi read model Nutrition nyata, Quick Record food aktif, dan rute meal tersedia. Bagian Slice 1 di bawah dipertahankan sebagai catatan fondasi; daftar fitur belum tersedia harus dibaca bersama laporan Nutrition terbaru.

## Slice 1 — Today Foundation

`GET /api/me/today` melewati `authenticated` (sesi Better Auth terverifikasi), kemudian `todayService` memeriksa consent current `health_data_processing` dan `descriptive_summaries`. Respons memakai kembali `profileService` dan `preferencesService`, selalu dengan identitas sesi. Identitas dari klien tidak digunakan.

Dependensi: `today → auth / consent / profile / preferences`; tidak ada modul existing yang bergantung pada Today. Tidak perlu repository tambahan: Today mengorkestrasi repository milik fitur existing melalui service masing-masing. Tidak ada cache server atau tabel universal baru.

## Kontrak dan waktu

Tanggal `YYYY-MM-DD` dan greeting dihitung dengan IANA timezone tersimpan melalui `Intl.DateTimeFormat.formatToParts`. Jam 05–10 pagi, 11–14 siang, 15–17 sore, selainnya malam. `generatedAt` adalah waktu respons, bukan waktu komputasi summary kesehatan. `computationVersion=today-foundation-v1`; `analyticsState=NOT_AVAILABLE`. Tidak ada klaim analytics READY atau histori kosong yang sudah ditelusuri.

`metrics[]` memuat domain dan availability `NOT_IMPLEMENTED`, value `null`. `goals`/`timeline` juga memiliki availability; items kosong hanya berarti feature belum tersedia. Nilai null tidak diganti nol. Provider Flutter saat ini membaca metadata tanggal, greeting, timezone, unit; kartu adalah preview foundation, belum renderer metrik domain. Saat domain pertama ditambahkan, perlu perluas model Flutter dan kontrak kartu untuk membedakan `AVAILABLE`/empty/partial secara eksplisit.

## Flutter dan lifecycle

`features/today/{data,application,presentation}` memakai ApiClient, secure bearer storage, Riverpod dan tema existing. Home tetap memakai greeting nama auth dan warning profil/consent existing, kemudian TodaySection. Profil dapat dibuka lewat avatar. FutureProvider autoDispose bergantung pada auth, consent, preferensi dan profil. Refresh/reload/error tidak menampilkan AsyncValue lama. Timer satu menit dan app resume memuat ulang tanggal/metadata; tombol muat ulang tersedia. Akses tanpa sesi tidak membuat request Today.

Pengujian provider pending-response saat pergantian akun belum terpisah; isolasi API dua akun sudah diuji. Tidak ada penyimpanan health lokal atau offline cache pada slice ini. Kegagalan koneksi menampilkan error dan retry. Foundation bukan klaim implementasi FEAT-10.

## Pengembangan berikutnya

Nutrition menambahkan domain record, form, revision dan query Today yang terbatas hari pengguna. Timeline/insight nantinya berasal dari record domain, tanpa duplikasi writable universal. Unit dan snapshot harus dipertahankan. Four-tab navigation dan Quick Record baru ditambahkan ketika destination tersedia. Setelah Nutrition, berhenti kembali untuk review kode.
</file>

<file path="architecture/glucose.md">
# Glucose — Slice 3 online

`features/glucose` owns schema validation, precise conversion, repository, service, routes and observation revisions. Existing Better Auth `authenticated` supplies the verified session user ID; `health_data_processing` consent is required for every observation endpoint. Descriptive reads additionally require `descriptive_summaries`. No new identity or authentication mechanism is introduced.

## Source and display semantics

Only self-reported manual capillary-blood glucometer readings are accepted. A saved reading is an observation copied by the user, not a device integration or verified clinical interpretation. `originalValue` and `originalUnit` preserve the entered measurement. The canonical `valueMgDl` uses Prisma Decimal and the existing project factor **18.016**, without display rounding. Display conversion rounds mg/dL to whole numbers and mmol/L to one decimal; when display and source units match, the original precision is retained. Changing preferences does not write observations or create revisions.

The technical canonical input/storage domain is 1–2000 mg/dL, with up to four original decimal places. This is an application guard, not a clinical target or interpretation. A user can flag an observation `needs_review`; it stays visible with `user_flagged` provenance and is excluded from aggregate values. No ranges, diagnosis, treatment instructions, time-in-range, interpolation or causal claims are produced.

## Transactions and corrections

Creation uses a client-generated UUID plus a server hash of the validated input. Retrying the same UUID/payload returns the existing record; different payloads conflict. Concurrent retries are resolved by the primary key and hash check. Ownership is always session-derived.

PATCH requires `expectedVersion` and a reason. Owner/version-scoped update, prior-state revision and metadata-only audit are one transaction. Sparse patches preserve all omitted fields; defaults do not clear notes/context or change units. Archive and restore are versioned corrections. There is no hard-delete endpoint. Conflicts return 409 and require review/reload; no last-write-wins overwrite.

## Read models

History uses descending `(measured_at, id)` keyset pagination, with owner-scoped cursor lookup, date and archive filters. Local date boundaries are computed by PostgreSQL using saved IANA timezone, including DST days. Read transactions use RepeatableRead.

Glucose daily summaries are computed from current active source rows on each read: counts, latest observation, review/eligible counts, and arithmetic mean/minimum/maximum after at least two eligible observations. Below that threshold these aggregate values remain null, with `INSUFFICIENT_DATA`; otherwise `READY`. Every result includes method version, timestamp, source and freshness. Corrections therefore affect the next read without a stale persistent projection. No daily_summaries/weekly_summaries table or background analytics engine is claimed here.

Today composes current Nutrition/Glucose daily models and the first five same-day timeline events. Timeline is now a separate feature querying a UNION of meal/glucose source records, ordered by occurrence time, domain and ID; its opaque cursor preserves tie ordering. It supports a legacy owner-scoped meal UUID cursor for compatibility. It is a read model, not a universal writable event table. The daily summary route moved from Nutrition to Insights and retains Nutrition's existing top-level response with a `glucose` member.

## Flutter

`features/glucose/{data,application,presentation}` uses existing ApiClient, Riverpod, go_router, Inter/theme tokens and form controls. New forms await preferences, default to the preferred unit, and clearly distinguish changing the input unit from converting a value. Edit forms always load original value/unit. Time selection is explicitly in device timezone; history/display uses server-supplied preference timezone.

Shared `AccountScopedRepository` captures the bearer token before writes and rejects writes when its owning provider/account is obsolete. Nutrition uses the same implementation. Record UUID generation, reason dialog and health cards/errors are shared. Account changes dispose dependent providers; no health records are cached durably on the client in this slice.

Successful mutations invalidate detail, history, daily and Today providers. Validation errors keep input editable; uncertain network/server outcomes freeze the submitted payload for retry, and version conflicts require reload. Forms guard unsaved changes. History shows only actual points on the current paginated page, without connecting lines or clinical ranges, alongside the full textual observation list and quality/source labels.

## Limits

This is an online vertical slice. Durable drafts, offline queue, sync operations, conflict review across devices, four primary tabs, complete Log/Insights screens, weekly summaries and later domains remain separate P0 slices. External CGM/device sources and all P1 features are inactive. Consent policy text remains a project draft requiring its own review.
</file>

<file path="architecture/nutrition.md">
# Nutrition architecture

Backend: `features/nutrition/{routes,schema,service,repository,model}.ts`. HTTP memakai wrapper dan authenticated guard existing. Zod memvalidasi input; service memeriksa consent dan mengorkestrasi transaksi Prisma; repository membaca record ownership/date-range; model menghitung Decimal dan coverage. Dependensi Nutrition hanya auth/consent/preferences serta shared infrastructure. Today mengonsumsi Nutrition; tidak ada siklus balik.

Create meal menyimpan parent dan snapshot items dalam satu transaksi. UUID dari klien dan hash input awal membuat retry idempoten; reuse ID dengan payload berbeda ditolak. Tidak ada universal writable health record table. Correct/archive/restore mengunci perubahan melalui updateMany id/userId/version, menyimpan previous view dan audit metadata dalam transaksi yang sama. Dua editor pada versi yang sama menghasilkan satu sukses dan satu konflik.

Food catalogue membedakan shared reference (`user_id NULL`) dan personal reference. API personal tidak bisa menulis shared reference, status clinically verified tidak dapat dipilih oleh pengguna. Nilai sumber dan nutrient per-100g disalin saat item dibuat. Koreksi existing item mempertahankan snapshot jika referensi tidak diganti, sekalipun katalog sudah diubah. Item bebas tanpa nilai gizi tetap valid dan unknown.

Read model Today dan daily Nutrition memakai date-range di timezone preferensi. PostgreSQL menghitung awal/akhir hari dengan AT TIME ZONE, bukan menambahkan 24 jam UTC. Pemilihan ID dan pembacaan detail list/daily berada dalam RepeatableRead supaya koreksi bersamaan tidak mencampur dua keadaan database. Filter arsip dan tanggal dapat dipakai bersama. Timeline menyajikan meal source IDs dan occurrence timestamp; supportedDomains secara eksplisit hanya meal.

Tidak ada cache server atau summary projection persisten pada slice ini. Read berikutnya selalu mengacu sumber current. Ini menghindari invalidasi projection yang belum dibangun; bukan klaim engine daily/weekly summaries lintas domain selesai. UI menginvalidasi Today/detail/history setelah write; account/consent/preferences menjadi dependency provider read.

Flutter: `features/nutrition/{data,application,presentation}`; Riverpod, go_router, ApiClient, token storage, theme dan form controls existing. Repository write menangkap bearer token sebelum request, memeriksa acting-account closure, dan tidak memakai token akun baru. Respons lama tidak diterapkan ke UI akun lain. Provider membaca ulang pada perubahan identitas/consent/preferences. Input belum disimpan dilindungi DiscardGuard. Error validasi tetap dapat diedit; network/server uncertainty mempertahankan payload untuk retry dengan ID yang sama; version conflict meminta reload.

Shared Quick Record launcher ada di `features/quick_record`, food aktif dan tiga domain lain disabled/belum tersedia. Rute form/history/detail berada di luar HomeShell untuk ruang form yang cukup; history punya jalur kembali Today dan detail punya aksi Beranda. Food editor adalah katalog pribadi, meal editor menyimpan kejadian sebenarnya—dua entitas ini tidak disamakan.

Belum ada local health persistence, offline queue, outbox, photo upload, recipes, verified portion conversions, external nutrition dataset, full timeline tab, weekly analytics atau domain tracking lain. Form time picker memakai timezone perangkat dengan label eksplisit; histori dan daily read memakai preference timezone. Tidak ada diagnosis, food/glucose causation, target medis atau rekomendasi pengobatan.
</file>

<file path="architecture/p0-integration-contracts.md">
# Remaining P0 integration contracts

Root owns Prisma schema/migrations, server.ts, global Flutter router/providers/auth/Today/Profile, medication feature and shared transaction helper. Workers own only assigned paths; coordinate shared changes through artifacts/messages. Existing Activity documentation edits belong to current user workflow and must not be overwritten accidentally.

## Goals schema (root will install)

BehaviorGoal: id/userId UUID, title String, goalType String(manual_checkins,activity_minutes,record_meals,record_glucose,walking_sessions), targetValue Decimal(12,2), period String(daily,weekly), startDate Date, endDate nullable Date, status String(active,paused,completed,archived), version Int default1, createHash String, createdAt/updatedAt TIMESTAMPTZ. user FK, checkins relation, revisions relation. GoalCheckin: id/userId/goalId UUID, eventAt TIMESTAMPTZ, status String(completed,skipped,unknown), value Decimal(12,2) default1, notes nullable, version1/createHash/archiveAt/createdAt/updatedAt and revisions. Add goalId/checkinId to exclusive RecordRevision source constraint. Check-ins manual confirmations, no glucose achievement scoring.

Goals endpoints resource pattern /api/me/goals and /:id; POST/GET /:id/checkins; PATCH /:id/checkins/:checkinId with correction version/reason; GET /:id/revisions and checkin revisions as needed. Exports goalsRoutes and goalsService with daily(userId,date?) plus owned list/get/create/update/checkin methods. Progress has explicit start/end period/source/coverage, distinct recorded days where appropriate. Derived activity sources exclude archived/needs_review. Active/pause/resume/completed/archive versioned with reasons; checkin requires active goal/date. Date-based week follows saved locale/timezone. Stable create UUID/hash; no ID ownership from body. Root offers inTransaction(callback,options?) helper (AsyncLocalStorage-flattened nested transaction) at shared/database/transaction.ts; use it in place of prisma.$transaction for writes so sync receipt/domain writes commit atomically.

## Medication schema/exports

MedicationRegimen: id/userId, name, strength, dosageForm, dosingInstructions, instructionSource(self_reported,clinician_reported), startDate/endDate Date, status(active,paused,inactive), version/createHash, createdAt/updatedAt. MedicationSchedule: id/userId/regimenId, localTime HH:mm, timezone IANA, daysOfWeek Int[] ISO1–7, enabled, effectiveFrom Date, disabledAt TIMESTAMPTZ nullable, createdAt. MedicationIntake: id/userId/regimenId/scheduleId nullable, scheduledAt nullable, takenAt nullable, eventAt TIMESTAMPTZ, status(taken,skipped,unknown), nameSnapshot/strengthSnapshot/formSnapshot/instructionsSnapshot, notes nullable, version/createHash/archivedAt/createdAt/updatedAt. Unique(scheduleId,scheduledAt) for one confirmation per occurrence. Revisions via regimenId/intakeId exclusive source keys. Schedules are versioned by disabling old rows; history snapshots preserved. No missed/adherence inference for unconfirmed doses. medicationService.daily(userId,date?) returns scheduled occurrences + confirmed counts; medicationRoutes exported. Intake creation POST /api/me/medications/:id/intakes, patch correction /:id/intakes/:intakeId.

## Summary projections

Root adds DailySummary and WeeklySummary: id/userId, summaryDate Date or weekStart Date, computationVersion, computedAt, coverageStatus, freshnessStatus(CURRENT,STALE), analyticsState(NOT_AVAILABLE,COMPUTING,READY,INSUFFICIENT_DATA,STALE,ERROR), metrics Json, unique(userId,date/version key). Read-model worker uses these names and fields; can request amendments before migration. Source writes mark user's projections STALE transactionally; read recomputes current daily/weekly source data. Stored projections derived only. No causal/clinical/TIR metric. Root updates recordAudit invalidation hook for domain event names with prefixes meal/glucose/activity/medication/goal and consent/preferences changes. inTransaction helper shares outer sync transaction.

Read-model routes: /api/me/timeline extends existing meal/glucose/activity with medication intake and goal checkin; stable opaque occurrence/domain/id cursor, owner-scoped date/type filters, source links. /api/me/insights, /api/me/summaries/daily (keep existing Nutrition top-level compatibility), /api/me/summaries/weekly. Full Flutter screens independent providers; root adds Routes.log=/log and Routes.insights=/insights under HomeShell TODAY|LOG|INSIGHTS|PROFILE and routes for source detail. Workers deliver hooks to invalidate their providers after changes. Timeline typed events include domain and recordId plus parentId for nested intakes/checkins; use that for original domain detail routing. Future unsupported/contextual analytics remain clearly unavailable, no invented correlations.

## Offline/server sync wire contract

POST /api/me/sync/operations body {operations:[{operationId UUID,domain:meal|glucose|activity|medication_intake|goal_checkin,recordId UUID,operationType:create|update,expectedVersion?:number,payload:object,parentId?:UUID}]} capped50. Each operation validated/session/consent/owner scoped and atomically applies domain write + durable receipt keyed(userId,operationId). Different payload same operationId409; retry returns stored result. Response {items:[{operationId,status:SYNCED|CONFLICT|NEEDS_REVIEW|SYNC_FAILED,recordId,result?:domainRecord,error?:{code,message}}]}. Unauthenticated entire request401; client never rebinds previous account operations to current token. GET /api/me/sync/status returns owned operation receipt summaries, no public health data. Sync is transactional per operation, not entire batch.

Root adds SyncOperation userId/opId/hash/domain/recordId/operationType/result Json/completedAt and ownership uniqueness. Root routes domain methods through inTransaction so nested source transactions share outer receipt. Offline worker provides durable encrypted per-account store using existing flutter_secure_storage (or coordinates necessary dependency), queue states DRAFT/SAVED_LOCAL/SYNCING/SYNCED/SYNC_FAILED/CONFLICT/NEEDS_REVIEW, serialized mutations/restart recovery, stable operations/record IDs and explicit retry/review/discard resolution. Cache/list/detail overlays use account-keyed records, never global in-memory health. Logout locks/isolate prior-user encrypted cache; consent withdrawal prevents processing/sync and clears or hides data appropriately. Existing repositories/forms will be integrated by root with worker's hooks, not duplicate forms. On local save, return usable provisional record with source payload plus local timestamps/version/status; server confirmation refreshes cache and summaries. Offline summaries must be labeled stale/unavailable rather than CURRENT invented metrics.

## Design boundary

Native FigCraft existing project pages13 Medication,14 Goals,15 Timeline,16 Insights,17 Offline/System,18 Responsive,19 Handoff created and rendered by root before new UI implementation. Use existing Inter/cool palette/semantic tokens and shared widgets. No new theme or unlicensed photo, no preview claiming device/reminder/ML support. Until design-ready checkpoint, workers may audit/write tests/backend/data but must wait before UI implementation.
</file>

