|---|---|---|
| 1 | `POST /api/auth/sign-up/email` | `200`; **langsung sesi aktif** (`Set-Cookie: better-auth.session_token; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Max-Age=604800`), `emailVerified:false`. Token sesi juga ada di badan JSON |
